+## 2026-09-14 continuous repair supply restored
+
+The controller had zero runnable work despite available provider quota. Fresh
+one-miss supply was accounted for, but repair discovery only checked the few
+example names in the dated plan. Eligible stale failures outside those examples
+were never reconsidered. Repair/conflict lanes now scan the full current review
+corpus in bounded resumable slices on every scheduled sweep.
+
+History follows numeric versions and cross-key successors; generic retries
+cannot take over dedicated integration recovery or controlled cohorts. Existing
+retry limits, full-card gates, worker/quota policy and the two-miss pilot bound
+remain. A refined live census found 209 remaining repair candidates. No manual
+batch enqueue or controller restart was required.
+
+114 tests passed. The controller automatically queued Akroan Hoplite v2 at
+05:35:44 UTC, then further Map repairs and their new Engine dependencies.
+Claude, Claude-2 and Codex claimed work; the watchdog reported active again.
+The reserve was still filling and five older integration failures remained;
+worker dispatch is not proof of accepted/integrated cards. No game deployment.
